WEBVTT

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
Kaze ni kami ga nabiku

00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:05.150
My hair flows in the wind.

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
Kokoro ni hirogaru aozora no deai

00:00:05.150 --> 00:00:10.720
An encounter in the blue skies of our hearts...

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Tooku hanaretetemo

00:00:11.290 --> 00:00:15.980
Though we are apart,

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
Kanjiru koto wa itsumo kimi dakara

00:00:15.980 --> 00:00:21.590
I'm always thinking about you,

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
Itsu no hi ka mune wo hatte

00:00:21.590 --> 00:00:26.930
so let's promise to meet again

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
Au koto wo yakusoku shiyou

00:00:26.930 --> 00:00:32.410
one day, with our heads held high.

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
Zutto futari owari no nai

00:00:32.410 --> 00:00:39.020
We'll be together, like a dream

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
Yume wo egaku you ni

00:00:39.020 --> 00:00:45.410
with no end.

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
Kimi ni

00:00:45.410 --> 00:00:47.440
I want

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
Kono omoi itsu no hi ka tsutaetai

00:00:47.440 --> 00:00:56.400
to tell you this someday.

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
Sabishisa wo shiawase ni kaeru tame

00:00:58.180 --> 00:01:07.370
I'm right here next to you

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
Soba ni iru yo kokoro wa

00:01:09.140 --> 00:01:16.460
to turn your loneliness into joy.

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
Konna ni chikaku ni kanjiru

00:01:17.380 --> 00:01:24.830
I can feel your heart so close to mine.

00:01:32.080 --> 00:01:34.900
The Tsukikage Acting Troupe's first production is <i>Little Women</i>,

00:01:34.900 --> 00:01:39.470
and Maya Kitajima, was handed her debut on stage...

00:01:39.470 --> 00:01:42.050
in the role of Beth.

00:01:42.050 --> 00:01:46.000
However, in her confusion and eagerness to keep up, she found herself falling behind in rehearsals.

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:51.800
Sayaka Minazuki tried to wrestle the role away from Maya.

00:01:51.800 --> 00:01:56.380
Then, Tsukikage told Maya to live as Beth for a week.

00:01:56.800 --> 00:02:01.090
You start with her feelings, and using those, you can bring forth her words and movements!

00:02:01.120 --> 00:02:06.080
The Purple Rose

00:02:07.010 --> 00:02:12.020
We will now conduct the audition for the role of Beth in <i>Little Women</i>.

00:02:20.340 --> 00:02:23.590
Ms. Tsukikage! Can I audition as well?

00:02:23.590 --> 00:02:24.390
Me too!

00:02:24.390 --> 00:02:25.700
Me too!

00:02:25.700 --> 00:02:28.250
I'd like to audition too!

00:02:29.030 --> 00:02:30.790
Fair enough.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:34.220
May the best actress receive the role of Beth.

00:02:35.870 --> 00:02:39.210
I would like all of you to please take a seat.

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:42.950
Little Women

00:02:39.820 --> 00:02:42.530
But you must sit as though you are Beth.

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:46.750
Right then!

00:02:47.740 --> 00:02:49.630
Begin!

00:03:07.190 --> 00:03:10.430
I've figured out what Ms. Tsukikage is trying to do.

00:03:10.430 --> 00:03:12.240
This audition is going to be hard.

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:13.500
What do you mean?

00:03:13.500 --> 00:03:17.010
If this was a short test, technique would be enough.

00:03:17.510 --> 00:03:22.370
But if you're acting for any length of time without movements or lines,

00:03:22.370 --> 00:03:24.680
that requires immense concentration.

00:03:30.360 --> 00:03:32.190
This is so boring.

00:03:32.190 --> 00:03:33.990
I feel like I'm going to yawn.

00:03:43.840 --> 00:03:47.240
What? She's started knitting!

00:04:42.040 --> 00:04:43.040
Beth!

00:04:43.880 --> 00:04:45.110
That's enough!

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:48.070
I've decided that Maya will play Beth.

00:04:48.750 --> 00:04:49.930
Thank you!

00:04:50.340 --> 00:04:52.300
I guess I lost this one, Maya!

00:04:53.000 --> 00:04:54.350
Thank you!

00:05:10.480 --> 00:05:14.140
She's doing well, but she can't play the piano...

00:05:14.140 --> 00:05:16.970
How are they going to do the climax of the play?

00:05:16.970 --> 00:05:18.590
You said it.

00:05:19.250 --> 00:05:24.080
This is the first time you've brought a girl home, Yuu!

00:05:24.080 --> 00:05:29.350
I realize I'm imposing and that I shouldn't have asked...

00:05:29.350 --> 00:05:34.220
Don't worry about stiff introductions. Here, put these slippers on.

00:05:36.340 --> 00:05:39.130
There, that's it. Play it more forcefully.

00:05:39.130 --> 00:05:40.740
Like this?

00:05:42.020 --> 00:05:43.500
Yes, that's it.

00:05:46.980 --> 00:05:49.740
Hi! I'm Tamami, his younger sister.

00:05:51.140 --> 00:05:52.670
This is Maya Kitajima.

00:05:53.080 --> 00:05:55.270
She's also an actor.

00:05:55.270 --> 00:05:56.760
Thank you for having me!

00:05:57.040 --> 00:05:59.170
Your family is very nice.

00:05:59.170 --> 00:06:00.290
They are?

00:06:01.670 --> 00:06:03.630
What a friendly family.

00:06:04.640 --> 00:06:07.090
All right, let's continue.

00:06:07.090 --> 00:06:08.260
Let's start again from the beginning.

00:06:08.260 --> 00:06:09.180
Yes, sir!

00:06:13.980 --> 00:06:18.580
Maya... I hope we can stand on the same stage one day...

00:06:27.940 --> 00:06:29.010
Maya!

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:32.920
That's <i>not</i> how someone breathes when they have a fever!

00:06:33.380 --> 00:06:36.340
Beth has scarlet fever, but on top of that, she's trying hard to hide her pain...

00:06:36.340 --> 00:06:39.700
so that her family - no, her sisters - don't worry about her!

00:06:40.110 --> 00:06:41.400
Try again!

00:06:41.610 --> 00:06:44.440
Don't worry, Jo, I'll be fine...

00:06:44.440 --> 00:06:49.270
You can't even tell us apart anymore! Poor Beth!

00:06:49.270 --> 00:06:53.840
When you see... the children...

00:06:53.840 --> 00:06:56.390
No, no, <i>no</i>!

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.400
Maya!

00:06:57.620 --> 00:07:01.060
Someone dying of fever would never sing that loudly!

00:07:12.930 --> 00:07:16.290
Do you understand the importance of this scene?

00:07:16.810 --> 00:07:21.210
Their mother and father have left! And Beth is dying!

00:07:21.210 --> 00:07:22.830
This is the climax of the whole play!

00:07:22.830 --> 00:07:24.320
Do you understand?

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:27.920
Yes.

00:07:30.590 --> 00:07:34.170
A Beth who doesn't understand this scene is a failure!

00:07:35.820 --> 00:07:40.500
A failure! A failure!

00:07:44.080 --> 00:07:46.020
Rei... what should I do?

00:07:46.020 --> 00:07:49.750
There's only three days left before the show and I...

00:07:49.750 --> 00:07:50.990
Maya.

00:07:50.990 --> 00:07:55.410
Someone who has never fallen cannot know the pain of falling.

00:07:55.800 --> 00:08:01.360
Most actors only learn by studying others who have fallen before them.

00:08:01.360 --> 00:08:02.710
Rei...

00:08:02.890 --> 00:08:06.710
You can't give up now, not after finally getting the role of Beth!

00:08:13.530 --> 00:08:17.180
I'm sorry, but Yuu isn't home at the moment.

00:08:17.180 --> 00:08:18.340
Oh, I see.

00:08:20.460 --> 00:08:21.750
I shouldn't...

00:08:22.840 --> 00:08:24.960
Why did you say I wasn't home?!

00:08:26.260 --> 00:08:29.280
This girl ran away from home, didn't she?

00:08:29.280 --> 00:08:31.680
Tamami said her friends told her.

00:08:31.680 --> 00:08:32.280
She did, but...

00:08:32.620 --> 00:08:35.270
But nothing. If you're going to go out with someone,

00:08:35.270 --> 00:08:38.490
why not choose someone better, like Ayumi?

00:08:40.020 --> 00:08:41.260
Maya?

00:08:48.770 --> 00:08:49.970
Maya...

00:08:54.480 --> 00:08:56.240
It's not like I didn't know.

00:08:56.240 --> 00:09:00.550
I mean, I'm not particularly pretty and I'm not good at anything.

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:02.800
So, why am I...

00:09:07.740 --> 00:09:09.300
Watch where you're going!

00:09:18.100 --> 00:09:22.540
Someone who has never fallen cannot know the pain of falling.

00:09:23.100 --> 00:09:24.460
Rain!

00:09:24.460 --> 00:09:26.860
I want to feel your frozen arrows!

00:09:26.860 --> 00:09:31.080
So I can feel chilled... to my body's core!

00:09:33.440 --> 00:09:35.980
If you find her, call my cell right away.

00:09:42.300 --> 00:09:43.500
And?

00:09:43.500 --> 00:09:45.570
We looked everywhere, but couldn't find her.

00:09:45.570 --> 00:09:46.750
I see.

00:09:53.260 --> 00:09:54.340
Maya!

00:10:01.000 --> 00:10:03.830
I'm finally starting to understand now.

00:10:06.670 --> 00:10:10.890
How could she be so careless? Running around like that on a cold, rainy night!

00:10:14.180 --> 00:10:15.370
Maya...

00:10:16.120 --> 00:10:21.770
Don't worry, Jo, I'll be fine...

00:10:36.530 --> 00:10:37.960
Ladies and Gentlemen.

00:10:37.960 --> 00:10:43.530
We would like to welcome you to the Tsukikage Acting Troupe's first performance.

00:10:51.460 --> 00:10:53.350
You really planned this one well, didn't you, Masumi?

00:10:53.350 --> 00:10:55.620
All the major critics are here.

00:10:55.620 --> 00:10:57.440
It was simple, really.

00:10:57.440 --> 00:11:01.970
There's a rumor going around that the future Scarlet Angel would appear on stage tonight.

00:11:01.970 --> 00:11:07.980
And tomorrow's papers will carry full reviews... Is that what you were planning?

00:11:08.450 --> 00:11:11.970
Fierce competition needs to be crushed as soon as it appears,

00:11:11.970 --> 00:11:15.580
so that we can finally make a performance of <i>The Scarlet Angel</i> a reality.

00:11:15.580 --> 00:11:19.180
Chigusa Tsukikage made a grave error when she made an enemy of you!

00:11:19.450 --> 00:11:23.160
Little Women

00:11:21.320 --> 00:11:23.190
A forty degree fever?!

00:11:26.150 --> 00:11:29.110
Maya said not to tell anyone.

00:11:33.250 --> 00:11:35.880
But I thought it'd be better to tell you after all.

00:11:35.880 --> 00:11:37.810
What are we going to do?

00:11:58.320 --> 00:12:00.500
I'm Beth!

00:12:03.650 --> 00:12:05.450
Sakurakouji!

00:12:08.710 --> 00:12:10.670
Are you all right?

00:12:16.280 --> 00:12:22.440
I don't think it's fair for some girls to have plenty of pretty dresses and other girls, nothing at all.

00:12:22.880 --> 00:12:29.440
We've got Father and Mother and each other too! Isn't that enough?

00:12:29.900 --> 00:12:36.820
Father... I wonder when he'll return from that distant war...

00:12:37.370 --> 00:12:38.560
Merry Christmas!

00:12:38.890 --> 00:12:40.700
Good morning, Marmee!

00:12:40.700 --> 00:12:42.910
Good morning, my dear girls!

00:12:42.910 --> 00:12:46.140
We must attend to the children forthwith, but...

00:12:43.930 --> 00:12:45.590
Ms. Tsukikage.

00:12:46.330 --> 00:12:49.750
How I've longed to star in <i>The Scarlet Angel</i>!

00:12:50.450 --> 00:12:56.490
Who do you plan on giving the role I've sought for so long?

00:12:57.160 --> 00:12:59.530
Which one of these actresses?

00:12:59.820 --> 00:13:03.190
They have no heating and they're too poor to even afford food!

00:13:03.190 --> 00:13:05.020
They are so hungry!

00:13:05.020 --> 00:13:08.210
Then, it's a good thing that we haven't started eating yet!

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:11.670
I'll bring the cakes and the bread!

00:13:17.420 --> 00:13:18.560
Beth...

00:13:19.750 --> 00:13:23.040
Let me take something too... the milk!

00:13:25.070 --> 00:13:28.230
The girl playing Beth is awful!

00:13:28.230 --> 00:13:30.510
The rest of the cast works, but...

00:13:32.310 --> 00:13:34.530
I don't believe that girl...

00:13:35.730 --> 00:13:37.220
Who?

00:13:37.510 --> 00:13:38.980
Maya Kitajima.

00:13:38.980 --> 00:13:41.340
Apparently, she's got a fever of forty degrees.

00:13:41.340 --> 00:13:45.740
They say she stayed out all night in the pouring rain so she could fully grasp the role of Beth.

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:47.010
How alarming.

00:14:06.640 --> 00:14:10.510
I'm sorry! I'm so clumsy!

00:14:10.780 --> 00:14:14.640
Well, well! Can someone please fetch some more milk for us?

00:14:14.640 --> 00:14:16.650
Shall we go?

00:14:16.650 --> 00:14:19.940
The less fortunate are waiting for their breakfast!

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:20.980
Let's go!

00:14:20.980 --> 00:14:22.110
This is ridiculous!

00:14:22.110 --> 00:14:24.590
Why do I feel so relieved?

00:14:24.820 --> 00:14:27.180
Shall we send on the understudy for Kitajima?

00:14:27.520 --> 00:14:29.250
We will do no such thing!

00:14:29.250 --> 00:14:32.320
Maya, you are the only one who can play Beth!

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:33.500
Ma'am...

00:14:33.500 --> 00:14:36.170
Yet, you plan on throwing your role away?

00:14:36.170 --> 00:14:38.470
No! I don't!

00:14:38.680 --> 00:14:41.470
Then, get up, Maya!

00:14:45.130 --> 00:14:46.690
You're on.

00:14:51.620 --> 00:14:55.550
That Maya Kitajima is not impressive at all.

00:14:55.550 --> 00:14:58.260
You said it. She doesn't strike me as anything special.

00:14:58.260 --> 00:14:59.510
Don't you agree, Ayumi?

00:14:59.710 --> 00:15:04.380
Maybe. But she's meant to be the quietest of the four sisters.

00:15:04.380 --> 00:15:08.260
She's not meant to speak all the time... she just watches them all with a loving gaze.

00:15:09.760 --> 00:15:12.310
That's the character of Beth, isn't it?

00:15:12.880 --> 00:15:14.530
Ayumi...

00:15:16.580 --> 00:15:18.580
All your lines were late!

00:15:18.580 --> 00:15:21.240
I couldn't concentrate because of the fever...

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:23.500
Are you going to blame the fever?!

00:15:30.290 --> 00:15:32.330
There! That should cool you down a bit!

00:15:32.330 --> 00:15:34.160
Now, get on that stage!

00:15:34.160 --> 00:15:35.230
Someone bring her a change of costume!

00:15:35.230 --> 00:15:36.820
We don't have time!

00:15:41.250 --> 00:15:43.280
You're overexerting yourself, Kitajima!

00:15:45.510 --> 00:15:48.730
A towel. Can someone fetch me a towel please?

00:15:49.630 --> 00:15:52.830
Beth? Beth? What have you been doing?

00:15:52.830 --> 00:15:55.860
I'm sorry, Meg!

00:15:55.860 --> 00:15:59.220
I was doing the laundry and I got myself all wet!

00:15:59.490 --> 00:16:01.270
I don't believe it.

00:16:01.270 --> 00:16:04.570
She was barely able to stand, off-stage...

00:16:08.210 --> 00:16:10.760
Open your eyes, Beth.

00:16:14.340 --> 00:16:16.600
This isn't a dream, is it?

00:16:16.600 --> 00:16:18.830
I don't believe it!

00:16:18.830 --> 00:16:21.300
This piano... it's for me?

00:16:21.300 --> 00:16:24.310
That's right. Old James Laurence gave it to you...

00:16:27.590 --> 00:16:31.020
Jo, I will thank old Mr. Laurence for the use of his piano!

00:16:40.850 --> 00:16:42.610
How strange...

00:16:43.170 --> 00:16:46.730
She seems to glow more and more...

00:16:48.350 --> 00:16:53.640
I think I've caught scarlet fever, Jo.

00:16:53.640 --> 00:16:56.670
Please Lord... save our Beth.

00:16:56.670 --> 00:16:59.600
I wish for nothing else!

00:16:59.780 --> 00:17:02.220
Please save Beth!

00:17:02.220 --> 00:17:07.340
Don't worry, Jo, I'll be fine...

00:17:07.700 --> 00:17:12.990
You can't even tell us apart anymore? Poor Beth!

00:17:12.990 --> 00:17:19.010
When you see... the children...

00:17:19.790 --> 00:17:25.760
a rose... in the meadow...

00:17:26.460 --> 00:17:28.870
She's trying to play the piano!

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:39.640
I'm fine... Father! Mother! Are you there?

00:17:40.430 --> 00:17:42.310
She's acting strange!

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:44.280
I'm going to telegram Mother!

00:17:44.280 --> 00:17:45.950
And I'll fetch the doctor!

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:51.630
'Twas so fair and...

00:17:51.630 --> 00:17:54.100
with youthful pride...

00:17:54.720 --> 00:18:00.630
he raced so fast to... be near its side...

00:18:01.070 --> 00:18:07.430
saw it with joy... o'erflowing.

00:18:07.640 --> 00:18:13.870
The red blossoms...

00:18:14.340 --> 00:18:20.600
growing on the heath.

00:18:21.870 --> 00:18:23.490
Her fever has broken!

00:18:23.490 --> 00:18:25.440
Oh thank the Lord!

00:18:25.440 --> 00:18:29.650
I could hear your voices the whole time!

00:18:30.210 --> 00:18:33.810
Your voices saved me.

00:18:34.320 --> 00:18:38.490
They said: "You mustn't die!" and "You are loved!"

00:19:02.680 --> 00:19:03.550
Maya!

00:19:11.750 --> 00:19:14.700
Little Women

00:19:13.390 --> 00:19:15.050
How did you like the show, sir?

00:19:15.050 --> 00:19:17.130
Can we just have a few words on your impressions of the play?

00:19:17.500 --> 00:19:21.520
Well, I must say, it had an appealing freshness to it...

00:19:21.520 --> 00:19:25.990
But, in the end, they were no more than a group of amateurs...

00:19:25.990 --> 00:19:28.170
It never went beyond a high-school production.

00:19:28.470 --> 00:19:31.660
You've erased all obstacles in your path.

00:19:32.110 --> 00:19:37.180
I hope you choke the life out of this little troupe.

00:19:42.390 --> 00:19:45.620
Why do I feel like I've been defeated?

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:48.270
I can't recall ever feeling like this before.

00:19:48.810 --> 00:19:51.480
What is the tremendous force that drives her?

00:19:52.210 --> 00:19:57.300
How can such a small body contain such overwhelming passion?

00:20:09.730 --> 00:20:10.780
Maya!

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:15.400
These are for you!

00:20:15.990 --> 00:20:17.510
For me?

00:20:18.890 --> 00:20:21.030
They were left at the front desk.

00:20:21.030 --> 00:20:22.890
Isn't it great?

00:20:22.890 --> 00:20:25.090
Your first fan!

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:27.870
Please be a healthy Beth soon.

00:20:22.910 --> 00:20:27.870
From: A Fan

00:20:30.870 --> 00:20:34.680
When I first met her, she was confused by pantomime.

00:20:36.300 --> 00:20:40.470
The next time we met, she faced me as an equal.

00:20:41.030 --> 00:20:44.340
And now, today... she was on stage.

00:20:44.340 --> 00:20:51.000
She's so focused on climbing the acting ladder, but I won't let her surpass me.

00:20:51.000 --> 00:20:54.490
I shall always stand above her!

00:20:55.770 --> 00:21:00.270
I wonder what kind of person my first fan is.

00:21:00.830 --> 00:21:04.790
But this has made me so happy! I don't even feel sick anymore!

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:09.500
Whoever sent me these purple roses: thank you.

00:21:12.970 --> 00:21:18.000
You tried to become a blue rose, but couldn't. You're a failed rose.

00:21:19.940 --> 00:21:23.290
Just like me.

00:21:25.500 --> 00:21:29.640
Risking her life to play the role of Beth, Maya took one step closer...

00:21:29.640 --> 00:21:31.570
to the big stage.

00:21:32.140 --> 00:21:37.600
But she has yet to break into Ayumi's league.

00:21:38.100 --> 00:21:44.060
Still, Maya took the well-wishes of her fan to heart and decided...

00:21:44.340 --> 00:21:47.990
she'd risk the treacherous path to the stage.

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:03.930
Gomennette iwaretara

00:21:58.020 --> 00:22:03.930
When you say "I'm sorry,"

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:10.670
Anata wo semerarenai yo

00:22:04.980 --> 00:22:10.670
I can't blame you.

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:21.510
Sonna watashi wo kitto shitterundeshou

00:22:11.950 --> 00:22:21.510
I'm sure you know that's how I am.

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:25.810
That's not fair.

00:22:21.510 --> 00:22:25.810
Nee zurui yo

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:33.620
Even if I'm being fooled by kindness,

00:22:26.510 --> 00:22:33.620
Yasashisa ni damasaretatte

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:44.210
I believed that with you, it might be worth it.

00:22:33.620 --> 00:22:44.210
Anata nara isso iito shinjita

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:53.690
Why are goodbyes so precious,

00:22:44.210 --> 00:22:53.690
Sayonara wa doushite itoshiindarou

00:22:53.690 --> 00:22:58.250
even though they mean we're separating?

00:22:53.690 --> 00:22:58.250
Hanareteyuku noni

00:22:58.250 --> 00:23:07.640
I remember how it got colder.

00:22:58.250 --> 00:23:07.640
Ushinatta ondo wo oboeteruyo

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:13.500
I want to forgive you, so please don't go.

00:23:07.640 --> 00:23:13.500
Yurushitai dakara anata

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:21.410
Whatever you do... just don't go.

00:23:13.500 --> 00:23:21.410
Ikanaide douka ikanaide

00:23:22.830 --> 00:23:27.740
I hear that Chigusa Tsukikage has suspicious ties with the director of a production company.

00:23:28.360 --> 00:23:33.150
And your performance in <i>Little Women</i> has been severely criticized.

00:23:34.080 --> 00:23:38.690
Apparently, the Tsukikage Acting Troupe will face dire consequences...

00:23:38.690 --> 00:23:42.000
if they don't win the upcoming acting competition.

00:23:42.980 --> 00:23:49.120
Maya, you overwhelmed everyone with your performance, so don't get down on yourself now.

00:23:47.120 --> 00:23:51.500
Episode 8 - Into the Wind
